- **Files**: Create `/apps/client/src/components/admin/ResolvePredictionModal.tsx`

### **2. Admin Dashboard - Ban/Unban Not Implemented**
**Issue**: Ban user button only logs to console
- **Backend**: Missing ban/unban endpoints
