  - `/apps/server/src/routes/admin.routes.ts`
  - `/apps/client/src/components/admin/UserActionMenu.tsx`

### **3. Object IDs Displayed Instead of Readable Data**
**Issue**: Multiple components showing raw IDs instead of names/labels
- **Affected Areas**:
  - Predictions showing creator ID instead of creator name
  - Bets showing option ID instead of option label
  - Activity feed showing user ID instead of user name
  - Transaction logs showing bet/parlay IDs without context
- **Fix Required**:
  - Ensure all API responses include populated relations
  - Update frontend components to display nested data
  - Add loading states while fetching related data
- **Backend**: Add `.include()` to Prisma queries
- **Frontend**: Update display logic in affected components

### **4. Missing Moderation Tools Integration**
